---
// agbox work handoff between Claude Code and Codex. Not shipped in Gandalf yet.
---

<section class="section handoff" id="handoff">
  <div class="container handoff__grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Handoff <span class="preview-tag">agbox · preview</span></p>
      <h2 class="h2">Start in Claude Code. Pick it up in Codex.</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        agbox keeps a short work contract for each task: what is done, what is blocked, what comes next.
        Both agents read it over a local MCP server, so switching agents no longer means re-explaining the task.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="artifact contract">
      <div class="artifact__head">
        <span>Work contract</span>
        <span class="contract__who">last touched by Claude Code · read by Codex</span>
      </div>
      <dl class="contract__body" data-print>
        <div><dt>Task</dt><dd>Fail check --ci when a declared skill folder is missing</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Status</dt><dd>In progress</dd></div>
        <div>
          <dt>Done</dt>
          <dd>Parse <code>[[skills]]</code> sources · Add project-only skill comparison</dd>
        </div>
        <div><dt>Blocked</dt><dd>Fixture repo has no <code>.gandalf/skills/</code> yet</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Next</dt><dd>Add fixture, then run <code>go test ./internal/cli/...</code></dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .handoff__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr);
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .contract__who {
    margin-left: auto;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .contract__body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 8px 0;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .contract__body div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 88px 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 10px 20px;
  }

  .contract__body dt {
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .contract__body dd {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .contract__body code {
    font-size: 0.85em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .handoff__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .contract__who {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
